the Cumbria LRF - Storm Fenella response - SITREP 12
Time of report: 17/01/2026 0900

1. SITUATION
Incident status: Recovery phase
Properties flooded: approx. 340 (unconfirmed).

2. SITES AND ROUTES
- A591 Keswick to Grasmere: closed both directions
- Riverside CC: stood down
- Glenridding village hall: rest centre closed (run by Westmorland and Furness)
- the Northside bridge: closed to all traffic
- the bridge at Pooley Bridge: open
- Cockermouth School: rest centre OPEN (run by Cumberland Council)
- Fellside: evacuated (run by Fellside Care Ltd)

3. AGENCIES RESPONDING
ENW, BRC, Cumberland Council, W&F Council, NWAS, EA North West

4. NEXT MEETING
SCG at 1600. Dial-in details as previously circulated.

